## 定理 L4：平方级数的精确指数率

$$
\boxed{
\lim_{r\to\infty}
\frac{\log\mathcal H_q(r)}r
=
Q_q.
}
\tag{L20}
$$

因此：

$$
\boxed{
\lim_{r\to\infty}
\frac{\log\mathcal Z_q(r)}r
=
Q_q-S_q
=
2\sum_j(\Im\lambda_j)^2.
}
\tag{L21}
$$

END_RAW_TEXT
